---
description: ContactBoxTools API usage for this repo
alwaysApply: false
---

- ContactBox is OpenAI-compatible at `https://api.contactboxtools.me/v1`
- Credentials live in env: `CONTACTBOX_API_KEY`, never hardcode keys
- Reasoning model: `gpt-5.6-terra` (fallbacks: `gpt-5.6-sol`, `gpt-5.5`)
- Image model: `gpt-image-2` at `1280x720`
- Use `src/lib/contactbox.ts` helpers (`createReasoningCompletion`, `generateThumbnailImage`)
- Test connection: `npm run contactbox:test`
- If errors mention deleted token group, user must create a new token at https://api.contactboxtools.me/console with seller-assigned Token Group
